    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the highly sought-after Eaton Wood development, this beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached property offers bright, spacious accommodation finished to a high standard throughout. Ideally positioned in a quiet residential setting, the property combines contemporary interiors with a private rear garden in one of South Dublin's most convenient locations..\n \nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with timber flooring, leading to a spacious front living room featuring a charming cast iron fireplace, bespoke fitted cabinetry and a large bay window, creating a bright and inviting reception space.\n \nTo the rear is an impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area, thoughtfully extended to provide generous living space. The modern fitted kitchen features an extensive range of sleek cabinetry, integrated appliances, a large central island and ample worktop space. The dining area benefits from vaulted ceilings with multiple Velux rooflights and impressive floor-to-ceiling glazing with bi-fold doors opening directly onto the rear garden, allowing an abundance of natural light throughout. There is also a useful guest w/c at this level.\n \nUpstairs, the property offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, all presented in excellent decorative order, together with a modern bathroom complete with both a bath and a separate shower enclosure.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front, gated side access and a private rear garden with a patio and lawn.\n \nEaton Wood Grove enjoys an excellent location in the heart of Shankill, offering superb convenience with a wide range of amenities nearby. Shankill Village provides an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, supermarkets and everyday services. Carrickmines Retail Park and Dundrum Town Centre are also easily accessible.\n \nThe area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with Shankill DART Station providing direct access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. Numerous Dublin Bus routes operate nearby, while the N11 and M50 are easily accessible.\n \nThere is an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools within the surrounding area, together with a wide range of recreational amenities including Shanganagh Park, Killiney Beach, Killiney Hill, Carrickgollogan Forest and several golf, tennis and sports clubs..\n \n104 Eaton Wood Grove offers well-appointed accommodation in an established residential location, benefitting from excellent transport links and a comprehensive range of local amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached property</li><li> Bright and spacious accommodation throughout</li><li> Extended open-plan kitchen and dining area</li><li> Modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances</li><li> Large central island with generous storage and worktop space</li><li> Vaulted ceiling with multiple Velux rooflights</li><li> Feature bi-fold doors opening onto the rear garden</li><li> Spacious living room with attractive cast iron fireplace</li><li> Bespoke fitted cabinetry and shelving</li><li> Three well-proportioned bedrooms</li><li> Modern bathroom with separate shower and bath</li><li> Excellent storage throughout</li><li> Timber flooring to the ground floor</li><li> Oil-fired central heating</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> Private rear garden with patio and lawn</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> Gated side access</li><li> Quiet residential developments</ul>"
      },
